  "project_description": "GenoRing is both a platform and a framework designed to handle biological data through an easy-to-deploy web portal that integrates \"à la carte\" bioinformatics tools. By promoting open science principles, GenoRing aims to empower laboratories and research teams -particularly those with limited resources- to effortlessly establish and maintain bioinformatics tools for curating and sharing their data.\n\n This Drupal module is only part of the GenoRing platform and provides a user interface for managing genomic data. It should be installed using the GenoRing platform .",
